2025-12-22T09:58:16.567Z [Filesystem] [info] Message from client: {"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"write_file","arguments":{"content":"# Path Conventions & MCP Integration\n\n**Version:** 1.0.0  \n**Date:** 2024-12-22  \n**Purpose:** Standardized path handling for cross-platform compatibility\n\n---\n\n## OVERVIEW\n\nThis document defines path conventions for weitergehts.online to ensure:\n1. **Cross-platform compatibility** (macOS, Linux, Windows)\n2. **Filesystem MCP-only access** (no native tools)\n3. **Relative paths** (portable across systems)\n4. **Consistent file operations**\n\n---\n\n## PATH ANCHOR POINTS\n\n### 1. Repository Root (`PROJECT_ROOT`)\n**Location:** Where `README_WiB.md` is located (Git repository root)\n\n**Usage:** Repository-internal files (templates, docs, scripts)\n\n**Notation:** Relative paths with dot (`.`)\n```\n./README_WiB.md\n./templates/unterricht/mikro/wib_tuv.md\n./docs/WiB_USER_GUIDE.md\n./scripts/init.sh\n```\n\n**MCP Access:**\n```\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"./templates/unterricht/mikro/wib_tuv.md\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. User Workspace (`WORKSPACE_ROOT`)\n**Location:** `~/weitergehts-workspace/` (user's home directory)\n\n**Usage:** Generated content, status files, user configs\n\n**Notation:** Tilde paths (`~`)\n```\n~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\n~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/2024-12-22_wib_7b_arbeitsplatz.md\n~/weitergehts-workspace/.config/wib_preferences.yaml\n```\n\n**MCP Access:**\n```\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\")\nFilesystem:write_file(\n    path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/file.md\",\n    content=\"...\"\n)\n```\n\n**Cross-Platform Resolution:**\n- **macOS/Linux:** `~` → `/Users/<user>/` or `/home/<user>/`\n- **Windows PowerShell:** `~` → `<drv>:\\Users\\username<unc> **Filesystem MCP:** Automatically resolves tilde\n\n---\n\n### 3. Symlinked Resources (`RESOURCES_ROOT`)\n**Location:** `~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/` (symlinked)\n\n**Target:** User's actual WiB resources location (flexible)\n\n**Usage:** Access to LehrplanPLUS, Skills, Anleitungen\n\n**Notation:** Tilde path through symlink\n```\n~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/lehrplan/\n~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/skills/WiB-TUV-Skill/\n~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/anleitungen/\n```\n\n**MCP Access:**\n```\nFilesystem:list_directory(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/lehrplan/\")\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/skills/WiB-TUV-Skill/SKILL.md\")\n```\n\n**Symlink Creation:**\n- **macOS/Linux:** `ln -s <source> <target>`\n- **Windows:** `mklink /D <target> <source>` (as Administrator)\n- **Script:** Automated in `init.sh` / `init.ps1`\n\n---\n\n## FORBIDDEN PATH PATTERNS\n\n### ❌ NEVER Use Absolute Paths\n```\n# BAD\n~/weitergehts.online/templates/...\nC:\\Users\\paulad\\weitergehts.online\\templates<unc>\n# GOOD\n./templates/...\n```\n\n**Why:** Breaks portability, only works on one machine\n\n---\n\n### ❌ NEVER Use Native Tools for User Files\n```\n# BAD (native tools)\nview(\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\")\nbash_tool(\"cat ~/weitergehts-workspace/status/file.yaml\")\ncreate_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/file.md\", ...)\n\n# GOOD (Filesystem MCP)\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\")\nFilesystem:write_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/file.md\", content=\"...\")\n```\n\n**Why:** \n- Native tools access Claude's computer, not user's\n- Filesystem MCP correctly accesses user's filesystem\n- MCP has proper permissions and cross-platform support\n\n---\n\n## FILESYSTEM MCP TOOLS REFERENCE\n\n### Reading Files\n```\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/file.yaml\")\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"./templates/mikro/template.md\")\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/lehrplan/file.md\")\n```\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `path`: Tilde or relative path\n- `head`: Optional, read only first N lines\n- `tail`: Optional, read only last N lines\n\n---\n\n### Writing Files\n```\nFilesystem:write_file(\n    path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/2024-12-23_wib_7b_file.md\",\n    content=\"# Content here...\"\n)\n```\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `path`: Tilde or relative path\n- `content`: String content to write\n\n**Behavior:** Creates or overwrites file\n\n---\n\n### Listing Directories\n```\nFilesystem:list_directory(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/\")\nFilesystem:list_directory_with_sizes(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/\")\n```\n\n**Returns:** List of files and subdirectories\n\n---\n\n### Directory Operations\n```\nFilesystem:create_directory(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/\")\nFilesystem:directory_tree(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### File Info\n```\nFilesystem:get_file_info(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\")\n```\n\n**Returns:** Metadata (size, modified date, etc.)\n\n---\n\n### Searching\n```\nFilesystem:search_files(\n    path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/\",\n    pattern=\"*arbeitsplatz*\"\n)\n```\n\n**Parameters:**\n- `path`: Root directory to search\n- `pattern`: Glob pattern\n- `excludePatterns`: Optional exclusions\n\n---\n\n## WORKFLOW EXAMPLES\n\n### Example 1: Load Context at Session Start\n```\n# Load user status\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\")\n\n# Load WiB context\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/wib_context.yaml\")\n\n# Load user preferences\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/.config/wib_preferences.yaml\")\n```\n\n---\n\n### Example 2: Generate TUV\n```\n# 1. Load template from repository\ntemplate = Filesystem:read_text_file(path=\"./templates/unterricht/mikro/wib_tuv.md\")\n\n# 2. Generate content (replace variables)\ngenerated_tuv = template.replace(\"{{thema}}\", \"Arbeitsplatz-Merkmale\")...\n\n# 3. Save to workspace\nFilesystem:write_file(\n    path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/unterricht/wib/mikro/2024-12-23_wib_7b_arbeitsplatz.md\",\n    content=generated_tuv\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Example 3: Update Status\n```\n# 1. Read current status\ncurrent = Filesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\")\n\n# 2. Update YAML (add new material)\nupdated = add_recent_material(current, new_tuv_path)\n\n# 3. Write back\nFilesystem:write_file(\n    path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/current_context.yaml\",\n    content=updated\n)\n```\n\n---\n\n### Example 4: Access Resources (Symlinked)\n```\n# List available LehrplanPLUS files\nFilesystem:list_directory(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/lehrplan/Fachprofil WiB/\")\n\n# Read specific Lernbereich documentation\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/lehrplan/Fachprofil WiB/LB02_Arbeit.md\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## CROSS-PLATFORM COMPATIBILITY\n\n### Tilde Expansion\n| Platform | Tilde (~) Resolution |\n|----------|---------------------|\n| macOS | `/Users/<user>/` |\n| Linux | `/home/<user>/` |\n| Windows (PowerShell) | `<drv>:\\Users\\username<unc>\n**Filesystem MCP:** Handles automatically\n\n---\n\n### Path Separators\n| Platform | Native Separator | MCP Handling |\n|----------|-----------------|--------------|\n| macOS/Linux | `/` (forward slash) | Use `/` everywhere |\n| Windows | `<unc>\n**Best Practice:** Always use forward slashes `/` in paths. MCP normalizes.\n\n---\n\n### Symlinks\n| Platform | Command | Administrator Required? |\n|----------|---------|------------------------|\n| macOS/Linux | `ln -s <source> <target>` | No |\n| Windows | `mklink /D <target> <source>` | Yes (Run PowerShell as Admin) |\n\n**MCP Behavior:** Follows symlinks transparently\n\n---\n\n## TROUBLESHOOTING\n\n### Issue: \"File not found\" with Tilde Path\n**Symptom:** `Filesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/file.yaml\")` fails\n\n**Ca…<truncated>
