n init script (creates workspace automatically)\n./scripts/init.sh    # macOS/Linux\n# OR\n.\\scripts<unc>\n# Init script creates:\n# - ~/weitergehts-workspace/ with full structure\n# - Symlink to resources (user specifies location)\n# - Default config files\n\n# 4. Update .gitignore (if needed)\necho \"**/.DS_Store\n.obsidian/\" >> .gitignore\n```\n\nDeliverable:\n- ✅ Clean repo (branch v3-mvp-wib)\n- ✅ Functional workspace structure via init script\n- ✅ Symlinked WiB resources\n\n**File Access Check:**\n```\n# Verify MCP can access workspace\nFilesystem:list_directory(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/\")\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/status/wib_context.yaml\")\n```\n\n---\n\n**DAY 3-5: TEMPLATE EXTRACTION**\n\nActions:\n1. Read original skill via MCP:\n```\nFilesystem:read_text_file(path=\"~/weitergehts-workspace/resources/wib/Skills/WiB-TUV-Skill/SKILL.md\")\n```\n\n2. Analyze: Input/Output specification (pages 1-10)\n3. Extract: Core TUV structure (6 phases, Lernziele, Kompetenzen)\n4. Create template in repository:\n```\nFilesystem:write_file(\n    path=\"./templates/unterricht/mikro/wib_tuv.md\",\n    content=extracted_template\n)\n```\n\n5. Simplify: Remove examples, keep structure (~5 KB target)\n6. Test: Manual substitution with example data\n\nTemplate Structure:\n```markdown\n# TUV: {{thema}}\n\n## Rahmendaten\n[Auto-filled: Datum, Klasse, Lernbereich, KW]\n\n## Kompetenzschwerpunkte\n[From wib_context.yaml + LehrplanPLUS]\n\n## Lernziele\n[Stundenziel + 3 Teilziele nach Mager-Schema]\n\n## Verlaufsplanung\n[6-Phasen-Tabelle]\n\n## Material\n[Konkrete Liste]\n\n## Reflexion\n[Post-Stunde Notizen]\n```\n\nDeliverable:\n- ✅ Functional WiB-TUV template (~5 KB)\n- ✅ Variables defined ({{thema}}, {{klasse}}, etc.)\n- ✅ Test with 1 example successful\n\n**Storage:** `./templates/unterricht/mikro/wib_tuv.md` (in repository)\n\n---\n\n**DAY 6-7: PROJECT INSTRUCTIONS**\n\n**Status:** ✅ Already done - `./README_WiB.md` exists\n\nVerificati